# Spike work: commit source / captured service-bag data / notes only.
# Everything is ignored, then specific SOURCE types are allowed back in, so
# compiled probe binaries (named with no extension) and shared objects (.so)
# stay out automatically.

*
!*/
!*.c
!*.h
!*.py
!*.java
!*.sh
!*.md
!*.plist
!Makefile
!.gitignore

# Belt-and-braces for captured secrets. The state/ dir holds the user's real
# device-identity / anisette / OTP material (cred_*.txt, deviceid, adi.pb).
# NEVER commit it. These patterns are scoped so they can't catch source files.
state/
cred_*.txt
adi.pb
